Rupture reality to temporarily open a passage to the aether, triggering [3, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] random arcane explosions in the target area.

Each explosion does [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; SP 100)] arcane damage in radius 2, and will each trigger at one turn intervals.

Subsequent casts will stack but the explosions will still only occur once per turn and will be centered at the last area targeted.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
